;pylm
; Font styles:
;    0: TDecorate(count=925, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    1: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=10, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=1053, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=937, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>That day arrived.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\桔梗実家.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Kikyo</STYLE>, are you ready?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This was goodbye to this house as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Father had allowed me to take just a few books with me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I told him I did not need them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because they were no longer something I needed.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\砂利を歩く.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\街並み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
On the way to the venue, I kept thinking.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had resolved never to regret again, yet my heart was not that simple.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I wanted to see <STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE> once more.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This time I would talk with him properly, and then, with <STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE>...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All I did was give myself up to that pipe dream.<PG>
No, this is no good.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I am a bride now, about to marry into another family.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It is disrespectful to the man who will be my husband.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At least on the outside, I must behave like one.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\鳥居.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I arrived at the shrine.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This was where the wedding would be held.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Today, here, I would meet my husband face to face for the first time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
............ 
{PAUSE ""}
Might <STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE> not suddenly appear here and take me away to Arata?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For a while, I gave myself over to that impossible fantasy.<PG>
No, no, I said that's enough.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Thinking about another man at my own wedding is unpardonable conduct.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I took one big, deep breath and passed through the torii gate.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was immediately shown to the back.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\神社控室.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Before I could even rest, my arms were put through the sleeves of the bridal dress.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then a great many makeup tools were laid out in front of me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All I did was sit there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My hair and makeup were all done for me.<PG>
All the while, I was thinking.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What is asked of me as a wife?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The man will surely be the son of a merchant, like Father.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A life where my husband runs here and there to scrape money together.<PG>
If so, then I must make a home where my husband can relax.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I will take care of the house, and let my husband think only of his work.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For a merchant, trust with his customers is what matters. It is his lifeline.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If it is cut, he will go bankrupt in no time and end up on the street.<PG>
Now, dressed like this as a bride, I am at last beginning to see this marriage in a positive light.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yes, from today I marry into another family.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I am to marry into a merchant family anyway, I will support my husband with all I have, so that he can become a great merchant who loses to none of the Great Powers.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My dreams and passion depend on how I think of them and how I use them.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE>, too, is surely living with all his might in a faraway land even now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If we ever meet again someday, I want him to see how much I have grown, as a woman and as a wife.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the one who becomes a cornerstone of a country that loses to none of the Great Powers will be my husband.<PG>
Come to think of it...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE> had said something that stuck with me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He had said it, but... what was it?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A whole month had passed, and I had forgotten.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------